                                "sense_id": "1cc0aa11-1975-324a-99a9-b4a0317deb3f",
                                "text": "Deducting one-third for rocks, cliffs, and places not susceptive of culture,—and for houses, buildings of all sorts, streets and roads, say 5,120; there remain, fit for cultivation, 10,240 English acres."
